#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  UI Window Manager
#  File: ui_window_manager.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS window manager responsible for:
#      • window creation & destruction
#      • stacking order (z-index)
#      • focus control
#      • movement & resizing
#      • window state transitions
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Window Creation](ca://s?q=Explain_Window_Creation)
#    - [Z-Index Stacking](ca://s?q=Explain_Z_Index_Stacking)
#    - [Focus Engine](ca://s?q=Explain_Focus_Engine)
#    - [Window States](ca://s?q=Explain_Window_States)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create(title, x, y, w, h)
#         Creates a new window.
#
#    - close(wid)
#         Closes a window.
#
#    - focus(wid)
#         Brings window to front.
#
#    - move(wid, x, y)
#         Moves window.
#
#    - resize(wid, w, h)
#         Resizes window.
#
#    - minimize(wid)
#         Minimizes window.
#
#    - maximize(wid)
#         Maximizes window.
#
#    - restore(wid)
#         Restores window to normal state.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full window manager state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  WINDOW STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "WIN-XXXX",
#      "title": "My Window",
#      "x": 100,
#      "y": 100,
#      "width": 800,
#      "height": 600,
#      "z": 12,
#      "state": "normal"
#    }
#
